{
 "_about": "Extras from Ship of Harkinian and the 3DS randomizer as new OoTR locations (tools/rando/parity/extras_npcs.py). Each feature is a remake setting, off by default; its locations, item-pool items and rule changes exist only while it is on (the plugin adds them after OoTR builds the world, as the story plugin does for the Master Sword pedestal), so with every setting off a seed is exactly what it is without the plugin. 'region' is an OoTR region, 'rule' an OoTR rule at least as strict as the game ('copy_rule_of': the rule and region of the OoTR location in the same goron cell). 'flag': the saved Bool that records the item as given (Bool, ResetTypeValue 8). Step data the patch hooks: data/rando/extras_npcs_data.json (_extras_npcs_build.py).",
